  "body": "# Change log\r\n\r\n## Improvements\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/qdrant/qdrant/pull/11533 - Make batch searches with the same filter on the same vector significantly faster\r\n* https://github.com/qdrant/qdrant/pull/11553 - Build HNSW graphs with the classic algorithm again by default, so `ef_construct` tunes graph quality on large segments\r\n* https://github.com/qdrant/qdrant/pull/11555 - Load collection configs without `ef_construct`, so a downgrade from 1.21 keeps working\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/qdrant/qdrant/pull/11408 - Fix a new peer failing to join the cluster when it joins right after a leader election",
